  "_notes": "Deploy as camera_settings.json on IMX307/Goke stations. Diffs vs the Hi/50H20L variant: Goke has no vpss_nr, no venc_cqp (chroma-QP -- parity gap), no gain/exp commands (uses manual -a/-d/-i/-e + auto --min/max-exptime). Goke-ONLY: dehaze off + ldci off (both ACTIVE by default under every Style and both distort science -- LDCI breaks photometric linearity, Dehaze applies a user LUT; the Hi/CV300 lacks these blocks). Style: typedefault verified clean -- DRC stays enable=0 across gain sweep (1x-22.4x) AND mode switch; the Goke does NOT exhibit the Hi's DRC re-creep, and typedefault==type2 in module-control (type1 only additionally bypasses CA). Gains 22.10 fixed pt (1024=1.00x), AGain max 22924, ISPDGain max 2048, wb base 256=1.0x. Bandwidth 21504 kbps (femac ~21.2 Mbps ceiling). Night gain + day WB are starting points -- tune per site.",
